00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:20,800
vaccinated, especially since they cannot use antibiotics.

00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,580
Do you have any thoughts or recommendations on how we can all mitigate the damage coming

00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:36,480
away from the recently publicized mRNA vaccines that are being used or are going to be used

00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:43,720
in our animal products or even regular vaccine products that we are already eating in our

00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:49,660
organic meat?

00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:53,900
This is really a tough one because this is heartbreaking.

